* ''The dogfood/keeper split'' (operator, 2026-11-07: //"Pono, approve the dogfood/keeper split."//). Two hearths of one kind answer two intents. The DOGFOOD hearth stands early from the runbook's own primitives, re-standable as often as needed (a single operator's re-found, 2026-10-31), so the house works from a live Lararium; `M5` builds on it as the spine. The KEEPER rite keeps every qualification the 2026-11-05 and 2026-11-06 rulings bind (#/milestones, `M4`); the dogfood stand waives none of them.

